##### CrustaBay  
*solo* 

An 18 L biofloc tank nurtures shrimp or crayfish with near-zero water exchange. A rotating drum filter clears solids while a PrecisionHeat™ water jacket maintains tropical warmth.

###### Crop Categories & Cultivars  
Crustaceans – all 10 Balcony varieties  

